# Three reeds to a key, a few cents apart. They are all at the same
# pitch - that is what makes it a musette rather than a registration -
# so the brightness has to come from the reed itself and not from
# stacking footages on top of it. The beat is the spray across the
# generator, and it is the same wheels for every key, so a chord
# shimmers as one thing instead of drifting apart.
